            <title>[ZEPPELIN-58] Test ZeppelinRestApiTest.getAvailableInterpreters is failing after adding new interpreter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-58</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When new interpreter is added, Test ZeppelinRestApiTest.getAvailableInterpreters is failing.&lt;br/&gt;
